        Expand $NAME, ${NAME}, ${NAME:-default}, ${NAME-default} in text.
        Returns a list of strings (the expanded parts).
        If quoted is True, the result is a single string (no field splitting).
        If quoted is False, the result may be split into multiple words.
        """
        result = []
        j = 0
        m = len(text)
        while j < m:
